    "text": "golaurens.com\nwebsite\nClinton\nThornwell homecoming will recognize 1995 state championship team\nBy MELISSA GIBSON,\n7 hours agoIt’s Homecoming week at Thornwell Charter School in Clinton and this year will be extra special. Thornwell High School was open through the 1990’s and early 2000’s, officially closing in 2007. They reopened as Thornwell Charter School, serving grades kindergarten through senior in 2019, making them a young school with a long history.",
